  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the effectiveness of Rural Water Supply and Sanitation (RWSS) services through decentralization and increased role of Panchayati Raj Institutions and local communities in the state of Uttarakhand and restore services of damaged schemes in disaster affected areas.</narrative>
